node_modules/

# The Reader's working copy of PDF.js: 201 files, 7.3 MB, unpacked from
# scripts/vendor/pdfjs-6.3.289.zip by scripts/vendor_pdfjs.py on every build.
# The zip is what the repository owns and what a version bump replaces; this
# is only what it becomes on disk.
#
# It used to be covered by a bare `vendor/` above, which matches a directory
# of that name at any depth — so js/vendor/ and scripts/vendor/ were ignored
# too, and the four files that live in them are tracked only because they
# were added before the line reached them. Anything added beside them since
# would have been passed over in silence. The slash keeps that line to
# Bundler's own vendor/bundle, and this one names the tree that really is
# generated.
js/vendor/pdfjs/
